<title>UK: Mowlem says performance ahead of last year.</title>
<headline>Mowlem says performance ahead of last year.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>British building group John Mowlem and Co Plc said on Thursday that while the early months of 1997 were as usual rather slow, the group's trading performance was ahead of last year.</p>
</text>
